data:{"type":"ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT","runId":"r1","threadId":"vision-b-content2","timestamp":1786769030006,"messageId":"a2ui-v-content2","activityType":"a2ui-surface","content":{"a2ui_operations":[{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"v-content2","catalogId":"https://opencode-agui-app.local/a2ui/data-agent-catalog.json"}},{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"v-content2","components":[{"component":"Column","id":"root","children":["badges","md-conclusion","warning-stock","insight-east","btn-refresh"]},{"component":"Row","id":"badges","children":["badge-default","badge-success","badge-warning","badge-danger"]},{"component":"Badge","id":"badge-default","text":"默认","variant":"default"},{"component":"Badge","id":"badge-success","text":"正常","variant":"success"},{"component":"Badge","id":"badge-warning","text":"预警","variant":"warning"},{"component":"Badge","id":"badge-danger","text":"紧急","variant":"danger"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"md-conclusion","text":"**分析结论**：华东大区以 30% 占比领跑销售，整体动销健康；但华南仓钢笔库存已跌破安全水位，需优先补货。"},{"component":"WarningCard","id":"warning-stock","title":"库存预警","text":"华南仓钢笔库存 42 低于安全水位 100"},{"component":"InsightCard","id":"insight-east","title":"洞察","text":"华东领跑占比30%"},{"component":"ActionButton","id":"btn-refresh","label":"刷新看板","variant":"primary","action":{"event":{"name":"refresh_dashboard"}}}]}}]},"replace":true}

data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-b-content2","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_003bb9757001IkFl3hH5V5B7in","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=v-content2 的 surface，必须恰好包含这 7 个组件，一个都不能少：1) Column(root) 2) Row(badges) 内含 Badge×4（variant 分别 default/success/warning/danger）3) Markdown（分析结论）4) WarningCard（title=库存预警 text=华南仓钢笔库存 42 低于安全水位 100）5) InsightCard（title=洞察 text=华东领跑占比30%）6) ActionButton（label=刷新看板 variant=primary action.event.name=refresh_dashboard）。WarningCard 和 ActionButton 必须出现。"},{"id":"msg_003bb9767001WNUpW2AlHYpmJ5-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI surface with exactly 7 components. Let me follow the component contract carefully.\n\nComponents:\n1) Column(root)\n2) Row(badges) containing Badge×4 with variants default/success/warning/danger\n3) Markdown (analysis conclusion)\n4) WarningCard (title=库存预警 text=华南仓钢笔库存 42 低于安全水位 100)\n5) InsightCard (title=洞察 text=华东领跑占比30%)\n6) ActionButton (label=刷新看板 variant=primary action.event.name=refresh_dashboard)\n\nWait, that's 6 components listed but user says 7. Let me recount. The user says \"必须恰好包含这 7 个组件\" - must contain exactly these 7 components. Let me count:\n1) Column(root)\n2) Row(badges) with Badge×4\n3) Markdown\n4) WarningCard\n5) InsightCard\n6) ActionButton\n\nThat's 6, but Badge×4 makes... hmm. Maybe they count the badges as 4 components? 6 + but wait. Let me count: Column(1), Row(2), Markdown(3), WarningCard(4), InsightCard(5), ActionButton(6), Badge... 4 badges = components 7,8,9,10. That's not 7.\n\nHmm, \"恰好包含这 7 个组件\" - maybe they count: Column, Row, 4 Badges, Markdown, WarningCard, InsightCard, ActionButton = 1+1+4+1+1+1+1 = 10. Not 7.\n\nOr count: Column(1), Row(2), Badge(3), Markdown(4), WarningCard(5), InsightCard(6), ActionButton(7). Maybe they count Badge×4 as one \"component\" group. Actually that gives 7 if we count Badge as a single component (with 4 instances). But \"一个都不能少\" - none can be missing.\n\nEither way, I just need to render all these components. Let me build the JSON.\n\nColumn(root) with children: [badges Row, Markdown, WarningCard, InsightCard, ActionButton]\n\nRow(badges): children are 4 Badge components with variants default/success/warning/danger.\n\nBadge: {text, variant?} - I need text for each. Let me give them texts like 默认/成功/警告/危险 or something. Maybe \"状态\" texts. I'll use reasonable text.\n\nMarkdown with analysis conclusion text.\n\nLet me create the components array. Flat array with ids. children reference by id. root id must be \"root\".\n\nLet me build it."},{"id":"msg_003bb9767001WNUpW2AlHYpmJ5","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_LJDfuNhi0ouXdD9Qktks2333","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"v-content2\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"badges\",\"md-conclusion\",\"warning-stock\",\"insight-east\",\"btn-refresh\"]},{\"component\":\"Row\",\"id\":\"badges\",\"children\":[\"badge-default\",\"badge-success\",\"badge-warning\",\"badge-danger\"]},{\"component\":\"Badge\",\"id\":\"badge-default\",\"text\":\"默认\",\"variant\":\"default\"},{\"component\":\"Badge\",\"id\":\"badge-success\",\"text\":\"正常\",\"variant\":\"success\"},{\"component\":\"Badge\",\"id\":\"badge-warning\",\"text\":\"预警\",\"variant\":\"warning\"},{\"component\":\"Badge\",\"id\":\"badge-danger\",\"text\":\"紧急\",\"variant\":\"danger\"},{\"component\":\"Markdown\",\"id\":\"md-conclusion\",\"text\":\"**分析结论**：华东大区以 30% 占比领跑销售，整体动销健康；但华南仓钢笔库存已跌破安全水位，需优先补货。\"},{\"component\":\"WarningCard\",\"id\":\"warning-stock\",\"title\":\"库存预警\",\"text\":\"华南仓钢笔库存 42 低于安全水位 100\"},{\"component\":\"InsightCard\",\"id\":\"insight-east\",\"title\":\"洞察\",\"text\":\"华东领跑占比30%\"},{\"component\":\"ActionButton\",\"id\":\"btn-refresh\",\"label\":\"刷新看板\",\"variant\":\"primary\",\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"refresh_dashboard\"}}}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_LJDfuNhi0ouXdD9Qktks2333","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_LJDfuNhi0ouXdD9Qktks2333","content":"UI surface \"v-content2\" rendered (10 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_003bbb528001CJzv5r7yvOauUJ","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 surface `v-content2`，包含全部组件：Column(root)、Row(badges)+Badge×4（default/success/warning/danger）、Markdown 结论、WarningCard 库存预警、InsightCard 洞察、ActionButton 刷新看板。"}]}

